{"id":"83526f6eba0eb8e2","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-interpretability-degree.md","title":"Mutual Interpretability and Degrees","display":"df-interpretability-degree — Mutual Interpretability and Degrees","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-interpretability-degree","aliases":["67-df-interpretability-degree"],"display":"df-interpretability-degree — Mutual Interpretability and Degrees","depends_on":["[[67-df-interpretability]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_chapter":"7","source_section":"§1","source_label":"chapter-opening definitions","source_printed_pages":[94],"source_pdf_pages":[105],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-interpretability-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-interpretability-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-interpretability-degree — Mutual Interpretability and Degrees"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"chapter-opening definitions"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>94</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>105</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A\">\\(L_A\\)</span> 为一阶算术语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A})\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A})\\)</span> 是由该语言中的理论构成的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal C\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}\\)</span> 是以下定义的二元谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]_{\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{int}}\">\\([A]_{\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{int}}\\)</span> 是相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 的等价类构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\unlhd B\">\\(A\\unlhd B\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 中解释，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>；这里在元语言中量化理论。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}B\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(A\\unlhd B\\land B\\unlhd A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}B\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(A\\unlhd B\\land B\\unlhd A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[A]_{\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{int}}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal C:A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[A]_{\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{int}}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal C:A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C/{\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}}\\coloneqq\\{[A]_{\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{int}}:A\\in\\mathcal C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C/{\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}}\\coloneqq\\{[A]_{\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{int}}:A\\in\\mathcal C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书第7章开篇（印刷94页，PDF105页）把相互可解释性的等价类称为解释度。这里补上旧文件缺失的等价类构造，并显式保留载体参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>；具体书中结构取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\mathsf{Ext}(T)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>。解释的反身性、复合下的传递性保证该关系为等价关系；本原子定义本身不声称任意类都可作为集合商的载体。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\unlhd B$ 表示 $A$ 可在 $B$ 中解释，见 [[67-df-interpretability]]；这里在元语言中量化理论。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书第7章开篇（印刷94页，PDF105页）把相互可解释性的等价类称为解释度。这里补上旧文件缺失的等价类构造，并显式保留载体参数 $\\mathcal C$；具体书中结构取 $\\mathcal C=\\mathsf{Ext}(T)$，见 [[67-df-degree-structure]]。解释的反身性、复合下的传递性保证该关系为等价关系；本原子定义本身不声称任意类都可作为集合商的载体。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A})","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]_{\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{int}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"A\\unlhd B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}B\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(A\\unlhd B\\land B\\unlhd A).","display":true},{"tex":"[A]_{\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{int}}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal C:A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}B\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C/{\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}}\\coloneqq\\{[A]_{\\mathcal C,\\mathrm{int}}:A\\in\\mathcal C\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\mathsf{Ext}(T)","display":false}],"bytes":1928,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\unlhd$ 见 [[67-df-interpretability]]，$\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}$ 见 [[67-df-interpretability-degree]]；不要求扩张 $A$ 一致。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-interpretability-degree]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-interpretability-degree]]"}],"outgoing":["44cd21d3d12e4d8d","f5b9611e728efd8b"]}